sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    box rgb(240, 248, 255) Client Side
    actor User
    participant App as React UI
    end
    
    box rgb(255, 239, 213) Server Infrastructure
    participant API as Express API Server
    participant DB as MySQL DB
    participant Cache as Redis
    participant ExtAPI as External API
    end
    
    User->>App: Clicks "Generate Weekly Plan"
    App->>API: POST /api/meals/generate (Token included)
    
    API->>Cache: Check if Plan cached?
    alt is cached
      Cache-->>API: Return Cached Data
    else not cached
      API->>DB: Fetch User Health & Allergy Profile
      DB-->>API: Returns Profile Data
      
      API->>DB: Fetch Local Suitable Recipes
      DB-->>API: Local Recipes Match
      
      opt Needs More Recipes
         API->>ExtAPI: Request New Variety Match
         ExtAPI-->>API: Return New Recipes JSON
      end
      
      API->>API: Algorithm structures 7-day schedule
      API->>DB: Save new Meal Plan to `meal_plans`
      API->>Cache: Set Plan Data Cache (TTL 1 hour)
    end
    
    API-->>App: Respond with generated Plan JSON
    App->>App: Render Plan onto the dashboard UI
    App-->>User: User sees their healthy menu schedule